  <name>LoveACE</name>
  <name xml:lang="zh-CN">LoveACE</name>
  <summary>Campus life and study toolkit</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="zh-CN">校园学习与生活一体化工具箱</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      LoveACE is an all-in-one toolkit for campus study and daily life. It aggregates
      course schedules, grades, exams, campus cards, electricity bills, competitions,
      labor clubs, repair requests, door access and teaching evaluation into a single app.
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="zh-CN">
      LoveACE 是面向校园学习与生活的一体化工具箱，聚合课程表、成绩、考试、一卡通、
      电费、竞赛、劳动俱乐部、报修、门禁与自动评教辅助等常用能力。
    </p>
  </description>
